{"municipality_code":"07542","pref":"福島県","city":"楢葉町","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"楢葉町には、山田岡村、山田浜村、前原村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には城跡や陣屋跡、寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「楢葉城跡」、「天神原遺跡」、「木戸八幡神社」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、山田岡村や山田浜村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 「Jヴィレッジ」や「マミーすいとん」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。 さらに平安期の地名として伝わる楢葉郷や白田郷を知っておくと、古い土地の呼び名にも気づきやすくなります。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":53,"rank":829,"percentile":56.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":33,"rank":765,"percentile":58.0,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":7,"rank":1128,"percentile":34.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":2,"rank":1236,"percentile":23.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":1,"rank":574,"percentile":56.3,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":11,"rank":1100,"percentile":39.9,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmar